<title>USA: Equinox says to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Equinox says to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SUNRISE, Fla. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equinox Systems Inc said Monday that its board of directors has authorized a plan for the company to repurchase up to an additional 1 million shares of its issued and outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Equinox said it has completed a previous 500,000-share stock buyback program authorized in November 1994.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made from time to time, subject to prevailing conditions, in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
